    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Warpmeld Pact",
    "summary": "Defensive use: whenever an enemy unit, once picked to shoot or fight, targets one or more of your TZEENTCH MUTANT units that are INFANTRY or MOUNTED, each targeted unit may perform a Warpmeld Sacrifice; a unit that does so has -1 applied to the Wound rolls of attacks aimed at it for the rest of the phase, and takes D3 mortal wounds as the phase ends. Offensive use: whenever one of your TZEENTCH MUTANT units that is INFANTRY or MOUNTED is picked to shoot or fight, it may perform a Warpmeld Sacrifice before choosing targets, in which case its models' attacks get +1 to their Wound rolls for the rest of the phase, and it takes D3 mortal wounds as the phase ends.",
